{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And Sarah laughed.</b> For she thought that the angel's word was merely a prophet's blessing, in the manner of Elisha (2 Kings 4:16) — not prophecy and a mission from the blessed El. And she thought that this would not be achieved for the aged through the blessing of any prophet, for indeed to restore youthfulness after old age is like the resurrection of the dead, which occurs through nothing but a particular command of El or through a prayer that finds favor from Him."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:33.252251935Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}